---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Manage outgoing compose signatures

Usage: mxr signatures [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list           List all signatures (default if no subcommand)
  set            Create or update a signature inline
  remove         Delete a signature by name
  defaults       List scoped default signatures
  default        Set a scoped default signature
  clear-default  Clear a scoped default signature
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
